---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { modelRelease } from '../../lib/model-pages';
import { homeModelGroups } from '../../lib/home-models';
const groups = homeModelGroups(); const release = modelRelease();
---
<Layout locale="en" title="Model API prices, billing conditions and evidence — MaaS Daily" description="Compare observed model API prices in their original currencies. Check billing conditions, data freshness, evidence and official pricing sources.">
  <section class="english-hero"><p>MODEL API PRICE TRACKING</p><h1>Understand the price behind each model API.</h1>
    <p>Check input, output and cache charges with their original currencies, units and conditions. Follow the evidence back to official pricing pages.</p>
    <p>Data through <time datetime={release.dataThrough}>{release.dataThrough}</time>. Both language versions use the same verified dataset.</p>
    <p><a href="/en/models/">Browse model prices →</a> · <a href="/en/pricing/">Search pricing records →</a></p>
  </section>
  <section><h2>Flagship and everyday models</h2><p>Grouped by official positioning, not benchmark rank. Selection reviewed {groups[0]?.reviewedAt}. Missing verified quotes stay visible; previous-generation models are not substituted.</p>{groups.map(group => <section data-home-group={group.id}><h3>{group.titleEn}</h3><p>{group.descriptionEn}</p><div class="model-grid">{group.models.map(page => <article data-home-model={page.pick.modelId}><h4>{page.modelHref ? <a href={`/en${page.modelHref}`}>{page.pick.name}</a> : page.pick.name}</h4><p>{page.pick.reasonEn}</p><p>{page.input ? `Observed input: ${page.input.amount} ${page.input.currency} per ${page.input.unitQuantity} ${page.input.unitName}; output: ${page.output ? `${page.output.amount} ${page.output.currency}` : 'not separately listed for this scenario'}.` : 'Verified quote pending.'}</p>{page.input && <p>{page.conditionEn} · Observed {page.input.observedAt.slice(0,10)}</p>}<a href={page.pick.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official positioning ↗</a>{page.modelHref && <p><a href={`/en${page.modelHref}`}>All billing conditions and evidence →</a></p>}</article>)}</div></section>)}</section>
  <section><h2>Compare conditions before costs</h2><p>Regions, service tiers, billing modes, context bands and time conditions may differ. We keep each condition visible and do not infer a lowest price across incompatible offers.</p><p>English content does not imply overseas registration, payment or API access. These capabilities have not been verified.</p><p><a href="/en/method/">Read the data method</a> · <a href="/en/agent/">Use REST, MCP, RSS or the Agent Skill</a></p></section>
</Layout>
<style is:global>
  .english-hero {padding:48px 0 30px;max-width:860px}.english-hero h1{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,56px);line-height:1.1}
  html[lang=en] main p{line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted)}html[lang=en] main a{color:var(--cyan)}
  html[lang=en] main section{margin-bottom:36px}.model-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:20px}
  .model-grid article{padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px}html[lang=en] code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .english-filters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;margin:20px 0}.english-filters label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
  .english-filters input,.english-filters select{padding:8px;background:var(--panel-solid);color:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px}
</style>
